### Calorie tracker – REST Client (VS Code: humao.rest-client)
### Start API: uv run uvicorn calorie_tracker.main:app --reload
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/entries

### Create entry
POST {{baseUrl}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oatmeal with berries",
  "calories": 280,
  "meal": "breakfast"
}

### Get entry by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/entries/1

### Replace entry
PUT {{baseUrl}}/entries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oatmeal",
  "calories": 220,
  "meal": "breakfast"
}

### Delete entry
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/entries/1
